DESCRIPTION:Flower Full Moon Paddle/Pedal Friday\, May 1\, 2026 | 7:30–9
 :30 pm Celebrate spring’s peak under the Flower Full Moon —named for t
 he abundant blossoms and vibrant growth all around us. Join us on Friday\,
  May 1st for a magical evening on the Petaluma River in deluxe Hobie pedal
  kayaks. Pedal along with us solo or with your friends\, family\, or that 
 special someone as the warm spring moon rises over “Petaluma’s Longest
  Park”\, the Petaluma River. This guided outing includes your kayak\, PF
 D\, an experienced guide\, and a beautiful moonlit experience—perfect fo
 r reconnecting with nature and community while honoring the season’s blo
 om. $60/person includes Hobie pedal kayak\, PFD\, lights and magic on the 
