DESCRIPTION:Fiesta Fiesta at The Floathouse 🎉 This year\, generous dono
 rs helped us bring the Hobie Fiesta to the river—a four-person pedal cra
 ft built for families\, friends\, pets\, picnics\, and pure fun. Now it’
 s time to celebrate this exciting new addition to the fleet… with a Fies
 ta Fiesta! 🕙 Event Details: Join us from 10 am to 3 pm for 20-minute sp
 ins for just $5 per person. Come take it for a spin and discover how fun i
 t is to get your whole crew out on Petaluma’s Longest Park . We’ll hav
 e fiesta-style snacks on the dock\, plenty of good vibes\, and lots of pho
 to-worthy moments with our newest “party boat.” The Fiesta features fo
 ur pedal stations and easy\, responsive steering—but this boat is so lig
 ht\, you can also take turns kicking back and enjoying the cruise. 🚣‍
 ♀️ Try it once… then start planning your next outing—because this 
 boat was made for longer adventures\, onboard picnics\, and celebrations o
 n the water. Give it a try\, and see how awesome it can be to take your wh
 ole crew out on Petaluma’s Longest Park. #block-7d174970dc05613579ef { }
