BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Thursday Sunset Paddle &amp\; Party 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T194500
UID:1238b42c37ed8d741d52fa293b2f6da6@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1773691764185-TC964OD6L426KH9ZTS24/Thursday+Paddle+
 %26+Party+2026+squarespace+calendar+size+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Thursday Sunset Paddle &amp\; Party Ease into the evening with
  a relaxed paddle on the Petaluma River\, followed by dockside snacks and 
 river community time. Once a month from April through September\, join The
  Floathouse crew for Thursday Sunset Paddle &amp\; Party . We’ll gather 
 for a 5:30 pm-ish launch and paddle together into the soft evening light o
 n Petaluma’s beautiful downtown river. As the seasons change\, the lengt
 h of the paddle will shift with the daylight—growing longer during the b
 right evenings of summer and shortening again as fall approaches. We’ll 
 always return to the dock about 30 minutes before sunset so everyone can r
 elax\, enjoy snacks on the dock\, and soak in the riverfront atmosphere. B
 ring a friend\, meet fellow paddlers\, and enjoy a midweek reset on the wa
 ter. 2026 Dates April 9 May 21 June 11 July 9 August 20 September 24 Prici
 ng $35 – Sit-on-top kayak or stand-up paddleboard rental (for the durati
 on!) $10 – Bring Your Own Board or Boat Open to SUP-per Club members and
  the public. SUP-per Club members\, this counts as one outing. It’s YOUR
  River. Come out &amp\; play! Book your spot here! #block-df2044a01b5c4339
