BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Downriver Run with Optional Sauna Refresh Sesh 
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260614T170000
UID:686101c63bef8c66ea1367c69aa07b03@thefloathousepetaluma.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/63
 02d39abd02437a9e9f0276/1766992270933-MW5ZCIEWI2559JS4ZGRS/Downriver+Escape
 +with+Optional+Sauna+Reset+Squarespace+event+page+%281500+x+1000+px%29.png
DESCRIPTION:Downriver Run + Optional Sauna Refresh Sesh 📅 Sunday\, June
  14⏰ Downriver Run: 3-5 pm. Optional Sauna + Cold Plunge: 5-6:30 pm Go w
 ith the flow. Ride the tide. Find the vibe. Join the crew from The Floatho
 use for a one-way\, two-hour glide downriver in Hobie pedal kayaks—power
 ed by your legs and the outgoing tide. This slow-lane journey follows the 
 Petaluma River south of town\, slipping quietly through hidden wetlands an
 d tidal habitat that most people never see\, and that can’t be accessed 
 any other way. As the tide carries you along\, you’ll pedal approximatel
 y six miles \, moving effortlessly through a living landscape of reeds\, b
 irds\, and broad skies. Egrets lift off ahead of you\, herons stand sentin
 el along the banks\, and the river widens into its wilder self. Along the 
 way\, we’ll share stories of this working tidal slough—its ecology\, i
 ts rhythms\, and why this stretch of river matters. At the finish\, reward
  yourself with the optional Refresh Sesh at Sundrop Sauna . Step into the 
 heat\, rinse\, reset\, and leave feeling energized—inside and out. Begin
 ner-friendly. Unforgettable. Be part of nature—and let the tide do the w
 ork. Book here. ($85 for downriver run\, $125 for downriver run + sauna re
 fresh sesh) Includes all gear\, snacks and drinks at the sauna\, and sauna
  &amp\; cold plunge experience. Bring towel\, swimming suit\, slides. Hobi
 e pedal kayaks provided. Transportation details\, meeting point\, and saun
 a timing shared after registration. Note: Most folks arrange for their own
  transportation back to town\, but with advance notice\, one of our staff 
 members or volunteers can give you a ride. #block-d5c574a17fbb82ea0f13 { -
 -tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px\; --tweak-text-block-radius: uns
 et\; --stroke-style: none\;--stroke-thickness: 6px\; --tweak-text-block-ba
